  "claim_boundary": "This development-only protocol supersedes theta0 v3 protocol.v1 only because attempt02 materialized bytes could not pass deterministic validate-existing: a wall-clock self-temporal timestamp entered the forced receipt and every downstream content identity. The old root remains immutable, cannot be resumed or reused, and grants no downstream authority. This v2 protocol replaces neither the failed theta0-v2 lineage nor the legacy forced-common-batch artifact. It reuses the already-spent source-v4 public and selected-action environment lineage together with an unqualified precomputed reader. Before output-root creation, the materializer must prove that the supplied implementation commit exists, equals current HEAD, owns the exact runtime publisher, temporal publisher, pulse seam, protocol, owner, and CLI blobs, and has no tracked or untracked package-code drift. A complete 112-child gate-v2 assignment federation is derived only from frozen public positions and must be written create-only, flushed, fsynced, closed, and reopened byte-exactly before any onboarding, forecast, or selected outcome branch. Every forced preaction uses the frozen logical temporal timestamp root_index*20+4+2*decision_index; credit remains root_index*20+5+2*decision_index, exactly one logical millisecond later. The sealed evaluator and full three-action commitment index are opened only after the first preaction fsync; only the actual selected branch may enter settlement and learning. Every root starts from literal None, replays four owner onboarding writes, then settles eight actual forced actions to PE-derived common-baseline credit without online gate updates; all onboarding writes and outcome writebacks must change owner persistence and every within-root handoff must close. The 112 complete child collections may be joined only into one parent APPLY/WITHHOLD transition pair; accepted lineage may claim zero child transitions only from the observed APPLY/WITHHOLD receipts. Success requires one 896-credit atomic APPLY, exact WITHHOLD preservation, nonzero finite informative parameters, zero cap hits, and cold condensation into one learned theta0 artifact. This proves only a development mechanism and allows design of a separate permanent public/outcome-free treatment-reachability admission. It is not a rehearsal, does not qualify the reader, does not estimate Learnable, Steerable, or any effect, and cannot establish unseen, formal, human, integrated, production, or four-able evidence. The cooperative Git, fsync, ordering, and accepted-lineage records are owner-path receipts; validate-existing can replay their exact bytes but cannot independently re-prove historical physical writes, OS process secrecy, or Windows directory-entry durability."
